WEBVTT

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:30.576
that ordinary black people
were spreading around the nation

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.480
and throughout the South.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.960
We had come to Lowndes County

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:40.240
to work in the movement.

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:44.456
And it was a nonviolent movement

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:47.200
to redeem the souls of America.

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:52.416
We believe that everyone,

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:54.976
both black and white,

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.840
people in the South,

00:01:57.920 --> 00:02:00.360
could find a redemptive pathway